'''Bundle of Magma Arrows''' is an {{Epic}} item obtained as an {{Odds|o}} drop from [[Inferno Demonlord]] {{SlayerTier|II}}+.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Bundle of Magma Arrows''' can be obtained from {{Stier|2}} or higher Inferno Demonlords if the player has {{Coll|Blaze Slayer I}}.

;Drop Chances
* {{Stier|2}}: {{Green|8.47%}} ({{Green|1/11.8}})
* {{Stier|3}}: {{Green|8.11%}} ({{Green|1/12.33}})
* {{Stier|4}}: {{Green|7.62%}} ({{Green|1/13.12}})

== Usage ==
If the player has {{Skill|Combat|XXV}}, a '''Bundle of Magma Arrows''' can be consumed to obtain 256 {{Item|Magma Arrow}}s. Arrows obtained are directly added to [[Quiver]]. These arrows are especially useful for Terminator users.

